menu "Devices (device_service)"

    config ALARM_HOME_CONTROL
        bool "Devices screen: lights, locks, climate from the panel"
        default y
        depends on SPIRAM && (ALARM_FEATURE_HA || ALARM_ZSRC_ZWAVE)
        help
            The home_control registry (docs/features/24, HCTL-010): devices the paired Home
            Assistant allows for control, and the panel's own Z-Wave switches, dimmers and
            garage doors (docs/features/41 phase B), for automations; unlock and open ask for
            a user code first, checked by the engine. Needs PSRAM and a device source (Home
            Assistant or Z-Wave: Z-Wave alone needs no Home Assistant link); off for small
            boards.

endmenu
